["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">訳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>翻译；理由；情况；缘故</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヤク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わけ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">原因；理由；根据；意思；含义；理智；道理；情况；情形；事由；恋情；风流韵事</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">翻訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほんやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">翻译；译文；破译；解码；（生物）翻译（依据信使核糖核酸合成蛋白质）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしわけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道歉；借口；托词</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">芝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>草坪；草地</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しば</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝居</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">戏剧；话剧；剧目</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝生</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しばふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">草坪；草地；草皮</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">芝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">草坪；草皮；草地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">綱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>纲要；缆绳；绳索；纲（生物分类）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">綱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">绳；绳索；线；横纲（大相扑最高级别力士）的编织腰带</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横綱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よこづな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（相扑）横纲（最高级别）；冠军力士；某领域最佳；精英中的精英；佼佼者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">典</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>法典；仪式；典籍；典范；规则</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テン・デン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふみ・のり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">辞典</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">字典；辞书；词典</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">典型</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">类型；样式；模式；典范；范例；原型；完美示例</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">古典</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">古典（作品，尤指书籍）；经典著作</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">賀</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>祝贺；喜悦</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祝賀</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅくが</span><span class=\"k-wz\">庆祝；祝贺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">扱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>处理；对待；操作；脱粒；接待</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ・キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あつか.い・あつか.う・あつか.る・こ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">扱う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつかう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">对待；款待；招待；处理；应对；解决；操作；使用；运用；买卖；经营；销售；论述；讨论；涉及；把A当作B对待；视A为B；调停；调解；难以应付；力所不及；说闲话；背后议论</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">扱い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あつかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">待遇；处理；应对；管理；操作；使用；作为……对待；把……当作</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り扱い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とりあつかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">处理；服务；经营；管理</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">顧</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>回顾；回头看；顾及；反省</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かえり.みる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">顧みる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえりみる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">回顾；反思；追忆；向后看；回头看；扭身看；考虑；留意；注意；放在心上</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">弘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>广阔；宽广；宏大</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・グ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひろ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">看